* ''Personal carries what a face keeps for itself'' (operator, 2026-11-11: //"Personal can absorb the new caps."//). `personal` holds what one face keeps for itself over the shared workbench as well as its view state, crosses that face's own devices alone, and projects per face to `personal/<F>/<slug>`, seeding back. Landed (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/api/disk-projection#/personal`>>).

